---
description: Use Mapped-Frontier Development for material product and delivery changes.
alwaysApply: false
---

For material product, architecture, security, deployment, data, API, or
operational work, read `@.mfd/core/mfd-contract.md` before making a plan or
implementation. Use the templates in `@.mfd/templates/` for Phase 0.
For deployment-aware work, read `@.mfd/deployment.yaml` and validate it with
`@.mfd/tools/validate_deployment_profile.py` before planning release actions.

Require an owning issue and immutable packet revision before material execution.
Approval never grants merge, deployment, issue closure, secret access, external
communication, or a production-success claim. Return a concise deviation brief
when an approved product or risk boundary changes.
